 ('ENT_MOC_JOHN_VIANNEY','patron_of','ENT_MISSION','low','The Curé d''Ars is patron of parish priests; loosely tied to the ecclesial-ministry domain.'),
 ('ENT_MOC_PADRE_PIO','aligned_with','ENT_MOC_JOHN_VIANNEY','low','Both are venerated as exemplary confessors of the modern era.'),
 ('ENT_MOC_JOHN_BOSCO','patron_of','ENT_MISSION','medium','Don Bosco founded the Salesians, a major teaching/missionary congregation for youth.'),
