 ('ENT_MOC_GIANNA_MOLLA','aligned_with','ENT_MOC_LOUIS_MARTIN','low','Both are modern exemplars of lay/married sanctity in family life.'),
 ('ENT_MOC_FRASSATI','aligned_with','ENT_MOC_GIANNA_MOLLA','low','Both are venerated modern Italian lay saints of ordinary life.'),
 ('ENT_MOC_SOLANUS_CASEY','aligned_with','ENT_MOC_PADRE_PIO','low','Both are 20th-c. Capuchin friars renowned for intercessory healing ministry.');
